    "text": "Lot No. 153 - 181 (Lots 3) allotments in total extent ofabout 0.0222 Hectare, of land in Cadastral Map No. 520024,Block No. 01 and Sheet No. 4 and dated 11.02.2015 preparedby the Senior - Superintendent of Survey of Colombo Districton behalf of Survey General, situated in the Grama NiladhariDivision of 593A - Rilawala in the village of Rilawala inDivisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Homagama in ColomboDistrict in the Western Province.",
